WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 14:1-15:10 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2615), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-11-27.

1
00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:25.350
When one of those at the table with him heard this,

2
00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.350
he said to Jesus,

3
00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:30.700
Blessed is the one who will eat at the feast in the kingdom of God.

4
00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.100
Jesus replied,

5
00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:39.050
A certain man was preparing a great banquet and invited many guests.

6
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:46.650
At the time of the banquet, he sent his servant to tell those who had been invited,

7
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.500
Come, for everything is now ready.

8
00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.900
But they all alike began to make excuses.

9
00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:01.110
The first said, I have just bought a field, and I must go and see it.

10
00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.150
Please excuse me.

11
00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:08.500
Another said, I have just bought five yoke of oxen, and I'm on my way to try them out.

12
00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.100
Please excuse me.

13
00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:14.700
Still another said, I just got married, so I can't come.

14
00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.800
The servant came back and reported this to his master.

15
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.500
Then the owner of the house became angry and ordered his servant,

16
00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:28.480
Go out quickly into the streets and alleys of the town

17
00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:32.200
and bring in the poor, the crippled, the blind and the lame.

18
00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:40.200
Sir, the servant said, what you ordered has been done, but there is still room.

19
00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.450
Then the master told his servant,

20
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.210
Go out to the roads and country lanes and compel them to come in,

21
00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.750
so that my house will be full.

22
00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:54.750
I tell you, not one of those who were invited will get a taste of my banquet.
